"{#viewing-activity-tracking-events-for-the-ibm-quantum-system-service}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Launching IBM Cloud Logs from the Observability page {#launching-ibm-cloud-"
"logs-from-the-observability-page}"
msgstr ""
"Spuštění IBM Cloud Logs ze stránky Observability {#launching-ibm-cloud-logs-"
"from-the-observability-page}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For information on launching the IBM Cloud Logs UI, see the [Launching the "
"UI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-"
"launch#instance-launch-cloud-ui) in the IBM Cloud Logs documentation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Informace o spuštění uživatelského rozhraní IBM Cloud Logs najdeš v části "
"[Launching the UI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-"
"instance-launch#instance-launch-cloud-ui) v dokumentaci IBM Cloud Logs.\n"

